// The player-looking enemies' looks (Warsong Gulch). Per class: every
// armor slot's pieces to pick one of (`ItemDisplayInfo.dbc` looks): its dungeon set 1 piece and up
// to ten level 50-60 greens and blues of its armor type it can wear, never an epic (`robes` are
// the chest pieces drawn as robes); its weapon sets, each a main hand, maybe an off hand and a
// ranged weapon of kinds it carries; and the rank 12 rare PvP set its ranked ones (elites, bosses)
// wear over head, shoulders, chest, legs, feet and hands, the Alliance's and the Horde's (a set a
// faction lacks borrows the other's). Every look comes from the server's item table, each item's 1.12 row
// (its highest patch).
// `jokes`: what a normal enemy's name starts with ("{Joke} {Class(1)}"), one picked for each.
// `player_names`: the made-up names a ranked one carries after its rank's title.
// `caster_boss_damage`: the share of a boss's swing a caster boss's spell hits for (it cannot be
// stepped out of); `boss_spell`: the spell a boss of that class casts instead of swinging (a
// character's own `boss_spell` comes first, and a moonkin casts Starfire; none slows).
// `boss_abilities`: what a boss of that class fights with, its class's
// looks, none that stuns, fears, roots or slows; a boss takes the first `class_abilities` (its zone
// file's), the numbers `enemy_kinds.ron`'s. `form_boss_abilities`: a druid's in each form instead.
